  "title": "Complete Sentences",
  "estimatedMinutes": 8,
  "explanation": {
    "en": "A complete sentence usually has a subject and a verb. An object is not always necessary.",
    "taglish": "Ang complete sentence ay usually may subject at verb. Hindi lahat kailangan ng object."
  },
  "examples": [
    "She is preparing the report.",
    "The meeting starts at nine."
  ],
